  [
    id 13
    label "MUvcWZ6Lcj8"
    step 0
    date "2021-08-22T13:17:33Z"
    title "How To Identify and Assess Jewelry Value With These Easy Tips. #jewelrymasterclass #jewelry"
    description "After  you spend some  time looking through jewelry of all types, you will start to get that  hang of it. Once you  know what  to look for, it becomes fairly routine to sift through lots of jewelry  pieces and  to be able  to tell whether or not it carries much  value.  &#10;&#10;Make  sure  to invest in jeweler's loupe so  that you can take a closer look to  find  marks. I have several and always keep one in my car too!&#10;&#10;#jewelrymasterclass #vintagejewelry #jewelry #gold #sterling #sterlingsilver #estatesale #estatesalefinds #estatesalehaul #ebayforbeginners #ebay #ebayreseller #reseller #resellercommunity #thrifting #goodwill #jewelry #jewelrybusiness #thriftstoreshopping #howto #shopping&#10;&#10;Here Are The Supplies We Use Every Day To Run the Business - &#10;&#10;Shipping Supplies:&#10;&#10;Thermal Printer: https://amzn.to/3dHjdnr&#10;&#10;Thermal Labels: https://amzn.to/3vd34vP&#10;&#10;Small Boxes:  https://amzn.to/2MXc3Ar&#10;&#10;Wrapping paper:  https://amzn.to/2LF4DB5&#10;&#10;Scale: https://amzn.to/3sjHyoj&#10;&#10;Packing Tape: https://amzn.to/3oFqLKf&#10;&#10;Tape Holder: https://amzn.to/39oxfXt&#10;&#10;Polybags: https://amzn.to/2XusDcH&#10;&#10;Bubble wrap:  https://amzn.to/3nyDz3B&#10;&#10;Various Boxes &#38; Mailers from USPS:  FREE BOXES FOR PRIORITY SHIPPING FOUND AT USPS.COM&#10;&#10;&#10;Photography Equipment:&#10;&#10;Seamless photography background paper:  https://amzn.to/3sgTeZ7&#10;&#10;Camera:   https://amzn.to/2L7ahw8&#10;&#10;SD Card: https://amzn.to/35yZ6mR&#10;&#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/2LnvF04&#10;&#10;Lights: https://amzn.to/3bIeu4j&#10;&#10;Shotgun Microphone/Stand Combo: https://amzn.to/38yxDU4&#10;&#10;Go Pro Hero 8 bundle: https://amzn.to/2Ls25q9&#10;&#10;Webcam: https://amzn.to/3i55d7d&#10;&#10;Amazon Basics Foldable Studio Light Box:  https://amzn.to/38y278Q&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Storage/Organization:&#10;&#10;&#10;Shelving: https://amzn.to/3bDtsIq&#10;    https://amzn.to/2XwtIAX&#10;&#10;&#10;Storage Containers:  https://amzn.to/3nBJbdE&#10;                                  https://amzn.to/39kDqfm&#10;&#10;Postcard Boxes:  https://amzn.to/38AkOc7&#10;&#10;&#10;Resell, reseller,  reselling, ebay reseller,  full-time reseller, ebay tips, ebay selling, etsy, what sold, what i found, what i got, how to resell, how to buy and sell, reseller tips, reseller guide, reseller advice, reseller how to, north carolina reseller, fipping, flipper, flips, vintage, antiques, antique, collectibles, thrifting, thrift store, garage sale, yard sale, estate sale, antique store, goodwill haul, goodwill find, pawn shop, sourcing, vintage thrift haul, retro, hot items, make money online, make money on ebay, work for yourself, e-commerce, rusty how to"
