    title "Vintage Jewelry Collection - A Look Inside Our October Collection + Repurposing Vintage Jewelry"
    description "WWW.THE-RECYCLED-LIFE.COM Shop our sale of 200 incredible vintage and antique jewelry pieces!! Sale goes live 10/28/2020 at 3:00PM PDT&#10;&#10;Things go VERY fast! So make sure to checkout as quickly as you can to secure your favorites! Items are not secured until you have completed the checkout process. &#10;&#10;Today we are sharing a sneak peek into some of our favorite pieces from this months jewelry collection. What was your favorite piece we featured? Let us know in the comments below!&#10;&#10;https://www.the-recyced-life.com&#10;&#10;Shop Selena's store The Vintage Bombshell: https://www.thevintagebombshell.com/&#10;Watch Selena's personal YouTube channel The Vintage Bombshell: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBE39BZlBFLFdCPsAeb0rsA&#10;&#10;Shop Laura's vintage finds Left Coast Revivals: https://www.leftcoastrevivals.com &#10;&#13;Instagram @LeftCoastRevivals&#10;Watch Laura's personal YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBWYtJGEJz76xYCIhipz2Ag&#10;&#10;Watch our feature on KPTV Good Day Oregon - https://www.kptv.com/good_day_oregon/more/they-call-themselves-two-vintage-obsessed-babes-now-the-stars/video_c9932a7d-77a7-54e3-bac8-bf49d6cbcbb9.html&#10;&#10;We are Selena and Laura. Just two girls with two completely different styles. Thrift with us! We're on a mission to spread style and awareness through vintage and thrifted finds. We love to go picking for vintage and antiques at yard sales, auctions, garage sales, thrift stores, and estate sales. We love old stuff and aren't afraid to dig! Sit back, get inspired, then get involved! &#10;&#10;&#13;&#13;Thanks for watching! &#10;&#10;See you in a new episode next Friday! =) &#10;&#10;Want to sign us on a major TV network?...&#13;&#13;We'd love our own show! ;) For Collaborations, contact Laura at laura.therecycledlife@gmail.com"
