    step 0
    date "2022-06-04T11:00:24Z"
    title "Vintage Jewelry Identification Saphirete and Saphirene"
    description "Vintage Jewelry Identification Saphirete and Saphirene. Saphirete jewelry can be both vintage and antique depending when the pieces are made. Although Saphirete and Saphirene are often used interchangeably for pieces of antique or vintage jewelry;there is a difference between the two, in both age and value. Join me today as I explain the differences, talk about the history, differences in values, and show examples. &#10;I will also be announcing the winners of my subscriber appreciation giveaways."
