    step 0
    date "2018-03-24T04:53:34Z"
    title "Vintage Cameo Jewelry - What are Cameos?"
    description "Hi all! Let's learn about cameo jewelry! I'll talk about what cameos are made from, shell carved cameos, coral cameos, identifying cameos both shell and resin, ways to date cameos and how to tell which are more valuable. Vintage Cameo Jewelry - What are Cameos?&#10;&#10;Some sites I discuss:&#10;https://www.jewelryshoppingguide.com/cameo-jewelry-guide/&#10;https://www.interweave.com/article/jewelry/cameos-101-history-creation-value-jewelry-plus-dark-haired-cameo/&#10;https://www.wikihow.com/Tell-if-a-Cameo-Is-Authentic&#10;http://www.ebay.com.au/gds/How-to-Tell-a-Real-Cameo-from-a-Fake-/10000000181849716/g.html&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xNLOuqolA7I&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C-hCRbVwdOE&#38;t=468shttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QZgyHmpX5Fo&#10;&#10;&#10;40 FREE Etsy Listings Promo - http://etsy.me/2nLNlDw&#10;Printful Sign Up - https://www.printful.com/a/texasgaltreasures&#10;&#10;Want to help support the Texas Gal Treasures Channel?&#10;http://PayPal.Me/texasgaltreasures&#10;&#10;Shop Amazon with my Affiliate Link:&#10;http://amzn.to/2CXEnIY&#10;&#10;Amazon Influencer-&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/texasgaltreasures&#10;&#10;Amazon Lists---&#10;&#10;My Shirts:&#10;Merch Shirts - http://a.co/eWtBRQj&#10;&#10;Tools I Use:&#10;Homeschooling - http://a.co/cm6eqew&#10;Photography - http://a.co/dnCK0Q8&#10;Packing &#38; Shipping - http://a.co/06WkASb&#10;Jewelry Tools - http://a.co/8Qfh27t&#10;&#10;Merch Links-&#10;Merch Patreon- https://www.patreon.com/texasgaltreasures&#10;Make Shirts Online - http://make-merch.com/&#10;Graphic Stock 7 Day Free Trial - Go to https://videoblocks.go2cloud.org/SH8Y&#10;Merch Informer Coupon Code -https://merchinformer.com/122.html&#10;Coupon Code : TexasGal    for 20% off your order&#10;&#10;TubeBuddy - https://www.tubebuddy.com/TexasGal&#10;&#10;Facebook Groups &#10;Jewelry Lovers and Sellers- http://texasgaltreasures.com/jewelry-group/&#10;International League of Thrifters - https://www.facebook.com