    description "I think it may too hot to shop here in New Orleans! My thrift store was devoid of actual people, but filled with fabulous vintage jewelry. We've got Boucher, we've got Jomaz, we've got Arthur Pepper and so many other goodies!  I hope you all have a great weekend, I thank you for tuning in!&#10;&#10;See something you like? Email me at Nolacollectibles@yahoo.com.&#10;Enjoy, like and subscribe!&#10;&#10;Shop Links&#10;Ebay - https://www.ebay.com/str/nolacollectibles&#10;Etsy - https://www.etsy.com/shop/NOLACollectibles&#10;&#10;Interested in the tools I use? Below are my Amazon links. I reach for these guys DAILY.&#10;Acid Testing Kit (essential and easy for testing precious metals)&#10;https://amzn.to/2WgMRXu&#10;Telescoping Magnet (for detecting precious metals or picking up coins, whatever you prefer, lol)&#10;https://amzn.to/2Ca9TIz&#10;Jewelry Loupe (to see all the teeny tiny purity marks)&#10;https://amzn.to/3euFGAW&#10;Jewelry Bags (To help me stay organized)&#10;https://amzn.to/2OqqA56&#10;Postal Scale (Keep everything accurate)&#10;https://amzn.to/3fvKF5P"
